---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Imprint"
  description="Legal notice for ismailapps.com: who is responsible for this website and how to contact them."
  updated="8 November 2026"
>
  <h2>Responsible for this website</h2>
  <address>
    {site.founder.legalName}<br />
    {site.founder.postalAddress}
  </address>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

  <h2>Business status</h2>
  <p>
    IsmailApps is the name under which {site.founder.legalName} offers software product services. It is not a registered
    company yet, so it has no company registration or VAT number. This notice will be updated with company details once a
    company is registered.
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible for content</h2>
  <p>{site.founder.legalName}, at the address above.</p>

  <h2>Liability for content and links</h2>
  <p>
    We write the content of this website with care, but cannot guarantee that it is complete, accurate or up to date.
    This website links to external sites, including client projects. Their operators are responsible for their content.
    If we learn that a linked page contains unlawful content, we will remove the link.
  </p>

  <h2>Client work</h2>
  <p>
    Supervise, Whatever AI, Vectum and Artbeak are products and websites owned by our clients. Their names and
    screenshots appear here as examples of work we contributed to.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
